          "kind": "hypothetical_only_counterexample",
          "raw_start": 478218,
          "raw_end": 478843,
          "raw_span": "<p style=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\"><b><i>We\nmay experience material weaknesses in our internal controls and financial reporting may limit our ability to prevent or detect financial\nmisstatements or omissions. As a result, our financial reports may not be in compliance with U.S. GAAP. Any material weakness, misstatement\nor omission in our financial statements will negatively affect the market and the price of our stock, which could result in significant\nloss to our investors.</i></b></span></p>",
          "readable_rendering": "We may experience material weaknesses in our internal controls and financial reporting may limit our ability to prevent or detect financial misstatements or omissions. As a result, our financial reports may not be in compliance with U.S. GAAP. Any material weakness, misstatement or omission in our financial statements will negatively affect the market and the price of our stock, which could result in significant loss to our investors.",
