          "raw_span": "<p style=\"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt\">This\nAnnual Report does not include a report of management&#8217;s assessment regarding internal controls over financial reporting due to\na transition period established by rules of the SEC for newly public companies.</span></p>",
