          "raw_start": 258500,
          "raw_end": 258891,
          "raw_span": "<p style=\"text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in\">In connection with the audit of our consolidated\nfinancial statements for the years ended June 30, 2024 and 2023, we and the auditors identified six significant deficiencies in our internal\ncontrol over financial reporting. The significant deficiencies related to the following:</p>",
